al_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-c7ca583b1273dacd3ea8cd81", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/bb3fab62e15aeadc7e7b586053e6fb89d75fd814d3551038bc2cec89876f83a6.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "bb3fab62e15aeadc7e7b586053e6fb89d75fd814d3551038bc2cec89876f83a6", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 628], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "d1d57653accb86b70fe686852bec5b4f6fc34f99a3dbfaf50059c99d68a99da7", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 177], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "b14219f3feaee10b696feca2b18b76daa9ad11bdda4915b6a8842eae8d746523", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 102], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "6249d8545a88bd1e7147ce0f86b5d9a7b49fabf3d292557b6c6220cbe786168b", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 76], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "8d6e001a10a5a6f1aa4bedcbfb7a5a00ea7957ac75d6603d89ff17418e453ac3", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "**归档附记：本条消息原附件顺序**\n\n1. `assets/29-07_58078_solution_01.png`。\n2. `assets/29-07_58078_question.png`。\n\n**对话正文（原文）**\n\n这道题我不知道哪里出了问题，算出来的结果跟答案好像不一样，能帮我理一下吗？\n\n我是这么做的：\n\n1. 看出 L1 的方向向量是 (2, 1, 0)，L2 的方向向量是 (1, 0, 1)\n2. 题目要求公垂线，代表公垂线的方向向量同时垂直于这两条直线的方向向量。通过两者叉乘得到公垂线的方向向量，也就是 (1, -2, -1)\n3. 设点：\n   (a) 在 L1 上设点 A 为 (2t + 3, t, t + 1)\n   (b) 在 L2 上设点 B 为 (u - 1, 0, u)\n4. 向量 AB 为 (u - 2t - 4, -t, u - t - 1)\n5. 根据共线比例关系列式：\n   (u - 2t - 4) / 1 = -t / -2 = (u - t - 1) / -1\n   解得 t = 2, u = 11/2\n6. 取 A 点为 (7, 2, 3)，通过点向式求出公垂线方程为：\n   (x - 7) / 1 = (y - 2) / -2 = (z - 3) / -1\n\n为什么算出来跟答案完全不一样？到底是哪里出了问题？\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.message .assistant #T18}"}